ace-notation\">73-df-pspace-notation</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\nS\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le S(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(n\\mapsto S(n)^2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\nS\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstr}\\land(\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\le S(n))\n\\to\\mathrm{NSPACE}(S)\\subseteq\\mathrm{SPACE}(n\\mapsto S(n)^2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PSPACE}=\\mathrm{NPSPACE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PSPACE}=\\mathrm{NPSPACE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-space-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-space-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pspace-notation","status":"resolved","id":"e7cace8b6c66b586","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pspace-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-nondeterministic-space-simulation","status":"resolved","id":"4f6c74e9e6793301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm